      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the kitchen, Kostya pats Max on the back and promises he will meet plenty of other experienced women. Then, refusing to let Vika's waitress strike paralyze the restaurant, Chef Barinov marches his entire brigade of cooks straight into the dining room carrying the guests' plates.",
